      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1905-01-28_WidnesExaminer_art0011" n="art0011">
        <head>We Offer £250 For a Disease Germ That Liquozone Cannot KUL</head>
        <p>We Offer £250 For a Disease Germ That Liquozone Cannot KUL</p>
        <p>Oa every bottle of Liquozone we publish an , offer of .C 250 for a disease germ that this product cannot kill.. We do this to convince you that ,Licinozone does germs. In hospital tests ex- tending over live years no form of deceased germ has been found to resist it. And it is the only way known to k 11 germs in the body without killing the tissues, too. Any drug that kills germ is a poison, and it cannot be taken internally, medicine is almost helpless in any germ disease, while Ligaozone is almost certain. his so effective, so certain, that we paid 20,000 for the British rights to Liquozone. And now we are giving a million bottles free, one to each of a million sick ones.</p>
        <p>Not Medicine. Liquozone is not made by compounding drugs. nor is there any alcohol in it. Its virtures are derived solely from gas—largety oxygen gas—by a process requiring immense apparatus and 14 clays' tirne.This process has for more than 20 years, heed the constant subject of scientific and chemical research. Each cubic inch of the product requires the use of 1,253 cubic inches of the gas. The result is a liquid which does much of what oxygen does. It is a nerve food and blood food— the most helpful thing in the world to you. Its effects are exhilarating, vitalising, purl fying. Yet it is an absolutely certain germicide. The reason is that germs are vegetables ; and Liquozone—tho very life of an animtl—is deadly to vegetal matter.</p>
        <p>_</p>
        <p>MI</p>
        <p>Liquozone goes into the stomach, into the bowels and into the blood, to go wherever the blood goes. No germ can escape it and none can resist it. The results are so certain that in any germ disease, no matter how difficult, we are wili- ng to send to every patient who asks it an abso- lute guarantee. Diseases which have resisted medicine for years yield at onca to Liquo zone and it cures diseases which medicine never cures And in curing the disease it purifies and tones the whole system, bringing the maximum of health. Germ Diseases.</p>
        <p>These are the known germ diseases. All that medicine can do for these troubles is to help Nature overcome the germs, and such results are indirect and uncertain. Liquozone attacks the germs, wherever they are. And when the germs which cause a disease are destroyed, the disease must end, and for over. That is inevitable. Asthma Hay Fever—lnfluenza Abscess—Anmmia Kidney Diseases Bronchitis La Grippe Blood Poison Leucorrhcea Bright's lisease Liver Troubles Bowel Troubles Malaria—Neuralgia Coughs—Colds Many Heart Troubles Consumption Piles—Pneumonia Colic—Croup Pleurisy—Quinsy Constipation Rheumatism Catarrh—Cancer Scrofu la—Syphilis Dysentery—Diarrhcea Skin Diseases Dandruff—Dropsy Stomach Troubles _</p>
        <p>Dyspepsia Throat Troubles Eczema—Erysipelas Tuberculosis Fevers—Gall Stones Tumors—Ulcers Gonorrhoea— Gleet Varicoceb: Goitre—Gotit Women's I)iseases</p>
