        <p>Royce t4tarted violently ; Sir Bruce was one of the greatest names in the medic:Al directory ; perhaps the most learned existir.g writer upon bacteria nod their development, etc. " Ito pomeible !" said Royce. " Why on earth sitou!a Sir Bruce interest himself about me lie will explain that and other matters if you care to call mad sce.him."..</p>
