        <p>The bottle contained liquid, in which floated a having the two attacks one after the other while cloudy yellowish substance, as to which Royer, you were there. He's taken another pupil, now, declined to hazard an opinion without careful ; and if I was asked I should say he wasn't fit for inspection and analysation. ! experimenting again just yet, but this new gent ' These are the microbes of a very terrible was in a burry to study his subject and go." disease," said Sir Bine() " there are sufficient ! The two men were now in a cab together here to infect and destroy the entire population hurrying towards Harley Street. t• of London." I " Has the pupil lost his head, then—or why -•- - - •</p>
