        <head>FOOTBALL.</head>
        <p>FOOTBALL.</p>
        <p>FOOTBALLBRS will be glad to know that the world famed manufacturers, GEO. G. EMMY &amp; Co., of Londo turn out Balls, which for quality, uniformity and durability are unique. These balls will be distinguished by the appear- ance thereon of their well-known trade mark. Ask the local Sports Dealer for G. G. B. &amp; Co.'s Price List. If not pro- curable, apply to 36 &amp; 38 Queen Victoria at.. London Factory —Peckham, 8.13. (76)</p>
